    // chat
    'chat.greeting' => "Hello! I am Mercurius, your personal agent.\n\n/new — start a new conversation.\n/stop — stop the current task.\n\nFor the owner: /permissions — saved permissions by groups and revoking them (/permissions server|job|project … — a selection, /permissions allow job|project|server|tool … — allow a whole area), /deny — bans: the list, /deny <area> <what> — ban (stronger than any grant; the owner of a project — in their project), /deny remove <id> — lift, /stream give|take <agent> — in a group or topic give or take back from an agent of the network the stream of this place, /streams — the streams of agents, /overview [#id|name] — a participant at a glance: jobs, rights, projects, grants, bans, secrets, mailboxes, streams, /usage — spend, /runs [count] [status] — recent runs, /trace <number> [step] — a run in detail or the prompt and answer of a step, /delegation — how the agent splits tasks, /memory — what I remember, /forget <number> — forget a fact, /dream (/consolidate) — memory sleep, /aliases — words that mean one thing, /probe — probes of memory, /projects and /project <name> — projects and the project of this chat (/project export <project> <password> — take a project out as a file, /project import <password> as the caption of the file — bring one in), /secret <name> <value> — keep or update a secret, /secret - <name> — delete it, /secret <project>: <name> <value> <site> — a secret of a project (its owner; /secret <project>: — the list, /secret <project>: - <name> — remove), /servers — servers, /server - <name> — remove a server, /audit — command log, /skills — skills, /mcp — MCP servers, /jobs — jobs, /hook — job webhooks, /doctor — installation check, /settings — settings, /set — change one, /restart — restart, /peers — agent network, /owner <number> — pass ownership of the agent on, /roles and /role — the roles of participants, /models — model roles, their history and a rollback (/models rollback <number>), /prompt — notes to the prompt and their scores (/prompt scores), /codex login — connect the ChatGPT subscription (models chatgpt:…), /antigravity — the Google Antigravity plan as a model provider (models antigravity:…; sign-in — /antigravity login), /export <password> — the agent archive, /import <password> with the archive file — replace the agent with an archive.",
