    'self.resources.no_limit' => 'no limit of its own (the sandbox container\'s limit holds)',
    'self.resources.sandbox_unused' => 'The participant\'s sandbox: disk up to %s (how much is used could not be learnt now); up to %d processes; up to %d s of processor time a command; memory a command — %s; up to %d commands at once.',
    'self.resources.sandbox' => 'The participant\'s sandbox: disk — %s used of %s (%d%%); up to %d processes; up to %d s of processor time a command; memory a command — %s; up to %d commands at once.',
