    'self.topic.skills' => 'skills: where they are (built-in, mine, the project\'s), how to create, change, import',
    'self.topic.tools' => 'my tools for this participant now, one line each',
    'self.topic.version' => 'the version of the app and the prompt',
    'self.topic.work' => 'long work: the plan of a conversation, workers, stages and steering them',
    'self.version' => 'App: %s; system prompt: v%d.',
    'self.work' => 'I keep work of three or more steps by the plan of the conversation (todo_list): items with statuses, one in progress; the plan lasts till the conversation ends and survives the compaction of the context. Parts go to workers (delegate_task): a part has its own tools and rights; after — which parts it comes after (their reports come to it), todo — which item of the plan it closes; background — in the background, then action list/steer/stop shows, steers or stops one background part. Workers do not talk to each other; I bring their reports together myself.',

