    'tool.media_prefs.about' => 'How to handle the files of the participant you work for, per kind (voice, audio, image, video, text, office): mode — auto (at once when they come), demand (on request with media), off (not at all); model — the preferred one among the owner\'s; rules — their principles of choosing a model in words. Save it when the participant says so ("do not transcribe voice messages", "look at receipts with the strong model"). show — the current settings, the owner\'s models and principles. An empty value returns to the owner\'s default.',
    'tool.media_prefs.mode' => 'auto, demand or off; empty — as the owner set',
