    'tool.memory_propose.old_text' => 'For replace and remove: the text of the entry word for word — the whole entry or a piece only it has.',
    'tool.memory_propose.predlagaet_vladeltsu_izmenit_dolgovremen' => 'Changes the long-term memory: a new fact (add) is written at once, the owner gets a notice and may forget it; a change, an end or a removal of an existing fact takes effect when the owner ',
