    'tool.peer_keys.about' => 'My keys for other agents: list — keys with fingerprints; create (key) — a new key; use (peer, key) — which key to present to a neighbour (an empty key — the main one). The neighbour has to let a new fingerprint in: its owner does /peer allow. Keys are made and chosen without the owner\'s approval.',
