    'tool.project_edit.secret_about' => 'Secrets of a project are set only by the owner of the project (or of the agent) in the private chat with /secret <project>: <name> <value> <site>; they have names of their own, each serves one site, and in the project it wins over a personal one of the same name. Members of the project use them in requests by name and see neither the values nor the list.',
