    'tool.project_edit.transfer_about' => 'Handing over: transfer offers the project to a participant; it becomes theirs only after their consent: they press a button or tell their agent to accept it (accept), or refuse (decline). The card, the tasks, the skills, the files and the jobs go with the project; bound chats and topics stay bound; the former owner keeps the full access until the new one takes it back. Only the owner of a project hands it over.',
