    'tool.self_info.about' => 'Facts about yourself by topic: how another agent connects to you, channels, commands, your tools now, modules, the participant\'s limits, self-improvement, version; the models and how to connect their provider — a Gemini API key, Vertex, the subscriptions ChatGPT, Claude and Google Antigravity (sign-in, quota) — the topic models; the MCP servers that ship with the agent (gemini-api — tools of Google by a key, ssh, mail) — the topic mcp; the VPN, the proxy and how the models, the browser and the sandbox go out to the network — the topic proxy (not network: network is the network of agents); the memory, processors and disk of the server and the resources of the sandbox — the topic resources. Without a topic: the list of topics.',
    'tool.self_info.index' => 'Topics of self_info:',
    'tool.send_content.about' => 'Sends what the messenger carries besides text and files — to this chat (the same topic) or to a participant (to): location (latitude, longitude); contact (phone, first_name, last_name); poll (question, options 2–10, anonymous, multiple); article (title, text in Markdown) — a titled formatted text. Files, photos, music and video — with send_file.',
